  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Brand introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>At KLARSKIN, we believe in harnessing the power of nature to reveal your skin's true radiance. Our mission is to provide innovative skincare solutions that prioritize both skin health and overall well-being. Inspired by the simplicity of natural beauty, our products are thoughtfully formulated with high-quality, plant-based ingredients and cutting-edge science. From probiotic-infused powders to gentle cleansers and nourishing serums, each KLARSKIN product is designed to deliver visible results while promoting a sense of balance and harmony within. Embrace your natural beauty journey with KLARSKIN and discover a skincare routine that celebrates the beauty of simplicity and sustainability.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>Product description:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Elevate your skincare routine with our Radiance Powder. Packed with essential nutrients and probiotics, this powdered supplement nourishes your skin from within, promoting a healthy complexion and balanced gut flora. Formulated to support skin clarity and radiance, our vegan and cruelty-free powder is the perfect addition to your daily wellness regimen. Unlock your skin's natural glow and embrace beauty that shines from the inside out with our Radiance Powder.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point): </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Powdered supplement the replenishes your gut and clears acne prone skin long term from within</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>Payment terms: <br><br></strong>Commission will be paid at the end of each month via paypal or bank transfer</p>",
